                                                "sense_id": "5c055685-aa26-336f-ab54-971785532c21",
                                                "text": "Francis was named for his mother's father and Jackson himself was named for his father's mother. Not that his grandmother was called Jackson, of course - it was a maiden name (Margaret Jackson) and it was a Scottish tradition, his father informed him."
                                            },
